    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d365">

                <pb facs="0598" n="1184" xml:id="pg1184"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.001 Chiang Kai-shek/8–849: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Korea</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Muccio</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Seoul</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-08-08T12:00:00+10:00">August 8,
                            1949—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>990. According information just received from Chinhae, Generalissimo took off
                    this morning about 10:30 presumably to return Formosa. Text joint <hi
                        rendition="#italic">communiqué</hi> issued on termination conversations
                    being telegraphed separately.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d365-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>President and Mrs. Rhee expected return Seoul Tuesday morning.</p>
                <p>Sent Department; repeated CINCFE.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d365-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Muccio</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d365-f1" n="1" xml:id="d365-f1-content">
                <p>See <hi rendition="#italic">infra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d365-f2" n="2" xml:id="d365-f2-content">
                <p>Commander in Chief, U.S. Army Forces in the Far East (MacArthur).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
